  "criticalReadings": [
    "Island2025/26 AndrewAdams and2024/25 AndyAdams are literal variants; no identity or name normalization.",
    "Island2015/16–2017/18 andPHSA2015/16–2017/18 print remuneration totals without a separate expense column; expenses missing.",
    "LaterIsland/PHSA totals include expenses; use numeric retainers/meeting/perdiem components for pay, exclude rates and meeting-day counts.",
    "Island2023/24 HaroldCull has dashed paycomponents and expense, printed total0; no remuneration zero inferred.",
    "Island2021/22 VivianHermansen paycomponents are blank/dashed with future-period payment footnote; supportingonly.",
    "PHSA2017/18 KenBassett and2015/16–2016/17 WynnePowell have nonnumericpay; supportingonly.",
    "VCH2022/23 printed annual total218077 includes known expenses5452; header onphysical2 fixes period despite coverdate2022.",
    "Providence2024/25 printed pay100000, expenses6450 include expenses of nonnumeric-pay rows. Providence2022/23 controls96500/3144 likewise.",
    "Providence2020/21 all18paydashes, totalexpenses231; Providence2021/22 all20paydashes, totalexpenses1372; no numericpayimports.",
    "Footnotes about meetings/travel paid later do not relocate observations to another disclosureyear."
